  "ruleText": "Phy 401.02 \"American Board of Physical Therapy Residency & Fellowship Education (ABPTRFE)\" means the entity that sets the standards by which clinical residency and clinical fellowship programs are conducted.\n\nSource. #9456, eff 4-17-09; ss by #10061, eff 12-25-11, EXPIRED: 12-23-21\n\nNew. #13825, eff 2-17-24",
